  "description": {
    "text": "The 2018 Pokémon World Championships, held from 24 to 26 August 2018 at the Music City Center in Nashville, Tennessee. Competitors got Champions Festival in eight languages, staff a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing from Top Thirty-Two up to Champion.\n\nTrophy cards, No. 1 to No. 4 Trainer, went to the top four of each age division in both the card game and the video game championships.",
